OpenCode is an AI coding agent that runs in the terminal.  It can work with
multiple AI providers to help inspect codebases, edit files, and run commands.

This port installs the official Linux x86_64 baseline binary through
MidnightBSD's Rocky Linux 9 emulation layer.  The wrapper disables Bun's BBQ
JIT, which is not supported by MidnightBSD Linux emulation.
